{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417510/extras/truck5.gif?t=1744840592\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Goblintown: Really Hard Driving Game is a fully-goblified vehicle obstacle course that puts you behind the wheel of a grumpl fart-boosted burger truck. As the most daring (or maybe stoopid) delivery driver in Goblintown, you\u2019ll navigate treacherous obstacles filled with hazardous boombooms, flap-tingling jumps, and other sadistic mayhem on your route. Deliver those burgers in record time and become the delivery gob of legend! And try not to die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417510/extras/RHDG_SteamStoreAssets_PageContent.png?t=1744840592\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have the gobflaps to survive the maniacal havoc and senseless scream-inducing hilarity of Funguspuss road and deliver Pumplescroob's lunch, or will you fly off the side and go boom boom like so many others?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417510/extras/truck4.gif?t=1744840592\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417510?t=1744840592","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744840592","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417510/670ef25e4b93f7be3dda9960470fe634c0722fab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744840592","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417510/670ef25e4b93f7be3dda9960470fe634c0722fab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744840592","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Shar